{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/advancechangetick()"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World"]]},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","title":"advanceChangeTick()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"advanceChangeTick"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ChangeTick","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule10ChangeTickV"}],"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/World.swift#L211","fileName":"World.swift"},"externalID":"s:11WorldModule0A0V17advanceChangeTickAA0dE0VyF"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Starts a new change tick, so components added or changed from now on are newer than every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"earlier tick."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/advanceChangeTick()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Detecting-Changes","title":"Detecting Changes","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/changeTick","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/lastRun","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/trackChanges(of:)"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@discardableResult","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"advanceChangeTick","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ChangeTick","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/